                <head>Supplementary treaty between the United States and Denmark for the extradition
                    of criminals</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">Signed at Washington November 6, 1905. Ratification advised by
                    the Senate December 7, 1905. Ratified by the President February 13, 1906.
                    Ratified by Denmark December 14, 1905. Ratifications exchanged at Washington
                    February 19, 1906. Proclaimed February 19, 1906.</p>

